# CJK, accented and emoji text, and a project with such a name, are added and saved as typed.
file <<END
Проекты 日本:
	- 既存
END
keys qq
type 牛乳を買う café 👍🏽 tomorrow
keys <Space> /
type 日本
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Проекты 日本
keys <Enter>
see - 牛乳を買う café
quit
saved <<END
Проекты 日本:
	- 既存
	- 牛乳を買う café 👍🏽 @start({today+1})
END
